// lumen-hello's taskbar icon: 64 px premultiplied ARGB8888 — the repo's lucide sun on the selection
// blue, a rounded square. Sent through xdg-toplevel-icon_v1, so the panel and the switcher
// show the window's own pixels (their first client to). Regenerate after editing:
//   rsvg-convert -w 36 -h 36 assets/icons/lucide/sun.svg -o sun.png
//   magick sun.png -channel RGB -evaluate set 100% +channel sun-white.png
//   magick -size 64x64 xc:none -fill "#3D6FB4" -draw "roundrectangle 0,0 63,63 14,14" \
//     sun-white.png -gravity center -compose over -composite rgba:icon.raw   # 64*64*4, straight
//   then premultiply into the words below.
